UPDATE products SET short_description='<p>Chocolate-flavoured protein powder for general dietary supplementation.</p>', description='<p>Protein Nutrition Powder 500 g provides a convenient powdered protein blend for users who want to supplement dietary protein intake. The listing avoids performance or disease claims and focuses on label-led use.</p>', ingredients='<p>Milk- and/or plant-protein blend with flavouring and micronutrients as specified on the final label.</p>', usage_info='<p>Mix and use according to the nutrition label and overall dietary needs.</p>', warnings='<p>Check milk, soy, nut and other allergen information. People with kidney disease or medically restricted diets should seek professional advice before high-protein supplementation.</p>', storage_info='<p>Seal the pouch after opening and store in a cool, dry place.</p>', seo_title='Protein Nutrition Powder 500 g | ShasthoCare', seo_description='Chocolate-flavoured protein powder for general dietary supplementation.' WHERE id=33;
UPDATE products SET short_description='<p>Lemon-flavoured electrolyte drink powder in convenient single-use sachets.</p>', description='<p>Electrolyte Drink Powder is a beverage mix designed for convenient hydration support. Each sachet should be mixed with the amount of water specified on the product label.</p>', ingredients='<p>Carbohydrate and electrolyte beverage blend as listed on the final label.</p>', usage_info='<p>Mix one sachet with the stated amount of safe drinking water and consume according to the label.</p>', warnings='<p>People who need to restrict sugar, sodium or potassium should review the nutrition label and seek professional advice when appropriate.</p>', storage_info='<p>Keep sachets sealed and dry, away from heat and moisture.</p>', seo_title='Electrolyte Drink Powder | ShasthoCare', seo_description='Lemon-flavoured electrolyte drink powder in convenient single-use sachets.' WHERE id=34;
UPDATE products SET short_description='<p>Iron and folic acid supplement in a convenient 30-tablet pack.</p>', description='<p>Iron + Folic Acid Tablet combines iron and folic acid in a simple supplement format. The listing emphasizes keeping iron away from children and using the product according to the labeled serving or professional advice.</p>', ingredients='<p>Iron salt with folic acid and standard tablet excipients.</p>', usage_info='<p>Use according to the package label or professional recommendation.</p>', warnings='<p>Keep iron supplements out of reach of children because excess iron can be harmful. Ask a healthcare professional about use in pregnancy, anemia evaluation, chronic disease or medicine interactions.</p>', storage_info='<p>Store dry below 30°C and away from children.</p>', seo_title='Iron + Folic Acid Tablet | ShasthoCare', seo_description='Iron and folic acid supplement in a convenient 30-tablet pack.' WHERE id=35;
UPDATE products SET short_description='<p>Multi-strain probiotic capsule supplement for general digestive-wellness positioning.</p>', description='<p>Probiotic Capsules provide selected live cultures in a convenient capsule format. Because probiotic products vary by strain and storage needs, the exact label should guide use and handling.</p>', ingredients='<p>Selected probiotic cultures with capsule excipients. Exact strains and CFU count should match the final label.</p>', usage_info='<p>Follow the product label for timing, serving size and storage requirements.</p>', warnings='<p>People who are severely immunocompromised, critically ill or under complex medical care should seek professional advice before probiotic use.</p>', storage_info='<p>Store exactly as directed on the package; some formulations may require cool storage.</p>', seo_title='Probiotic Capsules | ShasthoCare', seo_description='Multi-strain probiotic capsule supplement for general digestive-wellness positioning.' WHERE id=36;
UPDATE products SET short_description='<p>Non-medicated isotonic saline nasal spray for moisture and gentle rinsing.</p>', description='<p>Saline Nasal Spray 30 ml is a simple non-medicated saline product for nasal moisture and rinsing. The compact spray bottle supports hygienic individual use.</p>', ingredients='<p>Sterile isotonic saline solution.</p>', usage_info='<p>Use according to the label and keep the nozzle clean after use.</p>', warnings='<p>Do not share the bottle. Seek professional advice for persistent symptoms or use after nasal injury or surgery unless already directed.</p>', storage_info='<p>Store capped at room temperature and protect the nozzle from contamination.</p>', seo_title='Saline Nasal Spray 30 ml | ShasthoCare', seo_description='Non-medicated isotonic saline nasal spray for moisture and gentle rinsing.' WHERE id=37;
UPDATE products SET short_description='<p>Sterile lubricating eye drops for temporary dry-eye comfort according to the label.</p>', description='<p>Lubricating Eye Drops 10 ml provide a sterile ophthalmic lubricant in a small dropper bottle. The listing emphasizes dropper-tip hygiene and prompt assessment of concerning eye symptoms.</p>', ingredients='<p>Ophthalmic lubricating ingredients in sterile solution.</p>', usage_info='<p>Use only as labeled and avoid touching the dropper tip to the eye, fingers or other surfaces.</p>', warnings='<p>Stop use and seek professional advice for significant eye pain, injury, discharge, sudden vision change, persistent redness or worsening symptoms.</p>', storage_info='<p>Store as indicated on the pack and discard after the stated period following opening.</p>', seo_title='Lubricating Eye Drops 10 ml | ShasthoCare', seo_description='Sterile lubricating eye drops for temporary dry-eye comfort according to the label.' WHERE id=38;
UPDATE products SET short_description='<p>External-use topical pain-relief gel in a convenient 30 g tube.</p>', description='<p>Pain Relief Gel 30 g is a topical product intended for external use according to the final active ingredients and label directions. The listing keeps claims conservative and highlights safe skin use.</p>', ingredients='<p>Topical pain-relief active ingredients as stated on the final product label.</p>', usage_info='<p>Apply externally only according to the package directions and wash hands after use when instructed.</p>', warnings='<p>Do not apply to broken skin or near eyes. Review suitability with a healthcare professional if pregnant, allergic to anti-inflammatory medicines, or using similar topical products.</p>', storage_info='<p>Keep the tube closed and store away from excessive heat.</p>', seo_title='Pain Relief Gel 30 g | ShasthoCare', seo_description='External-use topical pain-relief gel in a convenient 30 g tube.' WHERE id=39;
UPDATE products SET short_description='<p>Reusable 2 L hot water bag for non-medicated warm comfort.</p>', description='<p>Hot Water Bag 2 L is a reusable warming accessory intended for careful household use. Safe water temperature and leak checks are important to reduce burn risk.</p>', ingredients='<p>Heat-resistant rubber or PVC bag with stopper, according to the final product specification.</p>', usage_info='<p>Fill and use according to the product instructions, using water at a safe temperature and a protective cover when advised.</p>', warnings='<p>Never use boiling water. Check for leaks or material damage before use and avoid prolonged direct skin contact, especially in children, older adults or people with reduced sensation.</p>', storage_info='<p>Drain, dry and store away from sunlight, heat and sharp objects.</p>', seo_title='Hot Water Bag 2 L | ShasthoCare', seo_description='Reusable 2 L hot water bag for non-medicated warm comfort.' WHERE id=40;
UPDATE products SET short_description='<p>Single-use glucose test strips for a compatible meter system.</p>', description='<p>Glucose Test Strips 50 pcs are designed for use only with the matching glucose meter platform. Accurate readings depend on correct storage, unexpired strips and adherence to the meter instructions.</p>', ingredients='<p>Electrochemical test strips compatible with the specified glucose meter system.</p>', usage_info='<p>Use only with the matching meter and follow storage, coding or calibration and blood-sampling instructions.</p>', warnings='<p>Expired, wet, damaged or incompatible strips can give unreliable results. Do not change treatment based solely on an unexpected reading without appropriate professional guidance.</p>', storage_info='<p>Keep tightly closed in the original container and within the labeled temperature and humidity limits.</p>', seo_title='Glucose Test Strips 50 pcs | ShasthoCare', seo_description='Single-use glucose test strips for a compatible meter system.' WHERE id=41;

